    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n801" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ădimplētĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		adimpleo. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			
			<i>A completing</i>, <i>completion</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">temporum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tert. adv. Marc. 5, 17</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A fulfilling</i>, <i>fulfilment</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">novum (testamentum) veteris adimpletio est,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lact. 4, 20</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
